1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,489
I'm on my phone all day, but I earn zero.

2
00:00:02,789 --> 00:00:07,405
Then stop scrolling and learn to fix phones! Open a mobile repair shop.

3
00:00:07,705 --> 00:00:09,925
But I don't know how to repair anything, Chacha!

4
00:00:10,225 --> 00:00:14,435
Do a three-month course. Then learn on the job at a shop for six months.

5
00:00:14,735 --> 00:00:20,183
Then ₹60,000 for tools, a soldering station and some spare parts.

6
00:00:20,733 --> 00:00:23,998
Son, my phone screen is broken. My grandson threw it!

7
00:00:24,298 --> 00:00:26,913
New screen in one hour, uncle. ₹2,000.

8
00:00:27,213 --> 00:00:34,935
Up to ₹800 profit on every screen. ₹2,000 to ₹3,000 a day, easily.

9
00:00:35,235 --> 00:00:42,226
And sell covers, chargers and screen guards. A ₹20 guard sells for ₹150!

10
00:00:42,526 --> 00:00:45,203
Sonu Mobile Wala, number one in town! Life set!
